# 换行统一：仓库里一律 LF，避免 Windows 上每次提交都报
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告、也避免别人 clone 后整库 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须 CRLF，否则某些环境下的 .bat/.ps1 会读不了
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做换行转换，也不做 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
